WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:32.375
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna explained

2
00:00:32.375 --> 00:00:37.000
that He is both the beginning
 and end of this entire creation,

3
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.791
both the origin and the dissolution.

4
00:00:39.791 --> 00:00:41.125
Now here, Lord Krishna explains

5
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:44.250
through a beautiful example

6
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.750
that He is also the sustainer
 of the entire universe.

7
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:55.041
In this verse, Lord Krishna explains to Arjuna

8
00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:58.166
through a beautiful example

9
00:00:58.166 --> 00:01:01.375
what His place is in this world.

10
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:02.625
Krishna says

11
00:01:02.625 --> 00:01:04.041
that just as pearls of a necklace

12
00:01:04.041 --> 00:01:06.208
are connected by a string,

13
00:01:06.208 --> 00:01:09.583
but that string is not visible to the eyes,

14
00:01:09.583 --> 00:01:12.208
only the pearls are visible.

15
00:01:12.208 --> 00:01:15.375
Just like that, Krishna, like a string,

16
00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:19.666
keeps this entire universe well-
organized, keeps it organized,

17
00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:20.250
but

18
00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:23.583
He Himself is not directly visible.

19
00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:26.083
In the previous verse, Krishna had explained

20
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:28.208
that the beginning

21
00:01:28.208 --> 00:01:30.500
and end of entire creation is from Him.

22
00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:32.458
Now here He is clarifying

23
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.000
that He is also the sustainer of creation.

24
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.625
He is all-pervading –

25
00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:37.541
pervading in all beings,

26
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:39.833
elements, and substances,

27
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:41.541
connecting all,

28
00:01:41.541 --> 00:01:42.625
but

29
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:46.291
He cannot be seen with material vision.

30
00:01:46.291 --> 00:01:47.875
Here we get a sense

31
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:49.916
of Lord Krishna's glory.

32
00:01:49.916 --> 00:01:52.708
The entire material and spiritual world

33
00:01:52.708 --> 00:01:54.208
depends on Him,

34
00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:56.750
and He is the original source of creation.

35
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:59.333
He is the supreme truth.

36
00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:02.875
When we adopt this understanding,
 then in every field of life,

37
00:02:02.875 --> 00:02:04.916
everywhere in the world,

38
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:05.875
every place,

39
00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:08.708
Krishna's power will start appearing to us.

40
00:02:08.708 --> 00:02:09.666
However,

41
00:02:09.666 --> 00:02:13.333
we can adopt this understanding completely

42
00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:14.708
only when we obtain this knowledge

43
00:02:14.708 --> 00:02:16.583
from the right source.

44
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:19.375
Either from Lord Krishna Himself like Arjuna,

45
00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:26.125
or from some guru who has completely
 understood Krishna, has known Him.

46
00:02:26.125 --> 00:02:29.208
Krishna is the original source of all powers.

47
00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:32.333
This entire universe depends
 on these powers of His.

48
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.291
Nothing is separate from Krishna,

49
00:02:34.291 --> 00:02:36.416
all are a part of Him.

50
00:02:36.416 --> 00:02:40.750
Whether it's some being or
 some lifeless substance.

51
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:44.041
When we adopt this truth, then everywhere

52
00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:46.250
we find Krishna.

53
00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.708
When in life

54
00:02:52.708 --> 00:02:58.375
everything seems scattered like
 pearls of a broken necklace,

55
00:02:58.375 --> 00:02:59.583
we often

56
00:02:59.583 --> 00:03:03.166
just get engaged in gathering those pearls.

57
00:03:03.166 --> 00:03:04.625
Get busy in immediate

58
00:03:04.625 --> 00:03:07.125
solutions to problems.

59
00:03:07.125 --> 00:03:10.500
We feel that if we just solve these

60
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.541
small problems,

61
00:03:12.541 --> 00:03:15.500
everything will be fine.

62
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.458
But then after some time,

63
00:03:18.458 --> 00:03:21.833
that same situation arises again.

64
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.250
The mind gets irritated –

65
00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:28.166
why does this happen only with me?

66
00:03:28.166 --> 00:03:29.958
The irony is this –

67
00:03:29.958 --> 00:03:35.500
that we manage the scattering
 circumstances for some time.

68
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.500
but don't think

69
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:41.791
that if life's pearls aren't kept tied,

70
00:03:41.791 --> 00:03:48.541
if deeply important matters
 of life aren't resolved,

71
00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:51.375
then these small problems

72
00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:54.291
will always keep troubling.

73
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:55.375
Because perhaps

74
00:03:55.375 --> 00:03:57.000
we've forgotten to

75
00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:01.083
strengthen the string that keeps life tied.

76
00:04:01.083 --> 00:04:03.625
Then life will scatter.

77
00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:07.250
This string can be your family's support

78
00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:09.416
which gives you strength.

79
00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:13.041
This string can be your parents' faith.

80
00:04:13.041 --> 00:04:15.750
Are you forgetting that somewhere?

81
00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.833
This string can be your spirituality.

82
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:23.500
Those moments of peace that 
give you deep understanding.

83
00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:26.541
This string can also be your principles,

84
00:04:26.541 --> 00:04:30.125
which need to be remembered again.

85
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:32.291
The main point is

86
00:04:32.291 --> 00:04:36.250
that you must peacefully consider this –

87
00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:38.333
in solving problems,

88
00:04:38.333 --> 00:04:41.625
have you become so busy

89
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.375
that you've started ignoring

90
00:04:43.375 --> 00:04:46.375
all these important matters?

91
00:04:46.375 --> 00:04:49.166
Have you forgotten the string

92
00:04:49.166 --> 00:04:52.000
that keeps your life tied?

93
00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.875
Family's support, parents' faith,

94
00:04:54.875 --> 00:04:59.458
your principles, your spirituality –

95
00:04:59.458 --> 00:05:02.916
if the string made from these is forgotten,

96
00:05:02.916 --> 00:05:05.458
then life will keep scattering.

97
00:05:05.458 --> 00:05:08.166
Keep this string strong.

98
00:05:08.166 --> 00:05:11.000
And yes,

99
00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:13.416
above all these,

100
00:05:13.416 --> 00:05:16.250
there's one more power.

101
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.875
Such a power

102
00:05:18.875 --> 00:05:23.250
that not only keeps family love, principles,

103
00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:28.500
and spirituality tied, but

104
00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:33.541
has also tied the entire universe.

105
00:05:33.541 --> 00:05:36.083
And that is 

106
00:05:36.083 --> 00:05:39.875
Me.

107
00:05:39.875 --> 00:05:44.291
Even though you may not
 be able to see Me directly,

108
00:05:44.291 --> 00:05:48.416
but like an invisible string,

109
00:05:48.416 --> 00:05:53.541
I have tied this entire world.

110
00:05:53.541 --> 00:05:57.291
Don't let it scatter.

111
00:05:57.291 --> 00:06:00.958
As you advance on the path of spirituality,

112
00:06:00.958 --> 00:06:04.500
you'll know

113
00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:06.166
that this entire world

114
00:06:06.166 --> 00:06:10.375
that is running smoothly, behind it

115
00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:12.625
is My hand.

116
00:06:12.625 --> 00:06:15.833
You'll know that I am

117
00:06:15.833 --> 00:06:18.958
that most important string

118
00:06:18.958 --> 00:06:22.416
that even in the most difficult times

119
00:06:22.416 --> 00:06:26.208
won't let you break.

120
00:06:26.208 --> 00:06:28.708
I am invisible,

121
00:06:28.708 --> 00:06:32.333
but always present.

122
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:36.000
Whenever you find yourself wandering,

123
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.458
find yourself surrounded by problems,

124
00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:42.541
find life scattering,

125
00:06:42.541 --> 00:06:46.875
then do try remembering Me.

126
00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:49.500
You'll find within yourself

127
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.750
courage to face difficulties, energy to rise again,

128
00:06:53.750 --> 00:06:59.375
and a flow of wonderful peace happening.

129
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:06.500
In a necklace of pearls,

130
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.250
the pearls appear shining,

131
00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:11.166
the string isn't visible.

132
00:07:11.166 --> 00:07:14.416
But this very string is

133
00:07:14.416 --> 00:07:17.666
what keeps all pearls tied,

134
00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:20.833
which isn't troubled

135
00:07:20.833 --> 00:07:24.250
that no one appreciates it.

136
00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.375
The string is happy in the pearls' shine

137
00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:30.958
and in their success alone.

138
00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:35.333
In the family too, some people are such

139
00:07:35.333 --> 00:07:38.708
who keep everyone tied, let others advance

140
00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:40.708
and shine,

141
00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:42.666
but remain behind themselves,

142
00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:45.041
aren't directly visible.

143
00:07:45.041 --> 00:07:46.375
But if

144
00:07:46.375 --> 00:07:50.458
they're not there, then the family's necklace

145
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.041
will scatter.

146
00:07:52.041 --> 00:07:55.250
This string can be anyone –

147
00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:59.000
family's elderly grandparents,

148
00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:01.791
or your parents,

149
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:04.833
those people who know only how to give,

150
00:08:04.833 --> 00:08:08.000
who know how to keep everyone united,

151
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.458
who provide strength to the family.

152
00:08:11.458 --> 00:08:13.958
Their knowledge and experience,

153
00:08:13.958 --> 00:08:18.250
their peace keeps the family stable.

154
00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:23.041
Often we pay attention only
 to the shining pearls –

155
00:08:23.041 --> 00:08:25.750
whose contribution is direct.

156
00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:28.458
In society too this happens.

157
00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:31.083
Someone achieved some big accomplishment,

158
00:08:31.083 --> 00:08:33.750
then we know only that person,

159
00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:36.291
accept only their contribution,

160
00:08:36.291 --> 00:08:40.291
and forget that there are
 some such family members

161
00:08:40.291 --> 00:08:43.500
or well-wishers cooperating with them

162
00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:48.291
whose contribution was equally important.

163
00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:49.791
Remember,

164
00:08:49.791 --> 00:08:52.583
even if the string isn't visible, but if

165
00:08:52.583 --> 00:08:56.791
it breaks, the pearls will scatter.

166
00:08:56.791 --> 00:08:57.791
Similarly,

167
00:08:57.791 --> 00:09:00.875
the family members who give support from behind,

168
00:09:00.875 --> 00:09:02.541
their importance often

169
00:09:02.541 --> 00:09:04.250
is understood when they're

170
00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:06.250
not present.

171
00:09:06.250 --> 00:09:08.125
Don't forget this string

172
00:09:08.125 --> 00:09:11.125
that gives cooperation and courage.

173
00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:13.541
In time, recognize their contribution

174
00:09:13.541 --> 00:09:17.500
and also appreciate it.

175
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.083
Those people aren't desirous of appreciation,

176
00:09:20.083 --> 00:09:21.125
but if

177
00:09:21.125 --> 00:09:24.291
they're given love and respect,

178
00:09:24.291 --> 00:09:28.250
then they'll definitely feel more empowered.

179
00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:32.541
The strength of that string will increase further,

180
00:09:32.541 --> 00:09:36.166
and their strength will also provide you

181
00:09:36.166 --> 00:09:38.916
strength and stability.

182
00:09:38.916 --> 00:09:41.333
I too, invisibly,

183
00:09:41.333 --> 00:09:44.166
have been helping you in every way

184
00:09:44.166 --> 00:09:45.750
and will continue to do so.

185
00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:49.500
Just maintain faith.

186
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:56.250
In professional life,

187
00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.125
whenever we achieve success,

188
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:01.416
it feels very good.

189
00:10:01.416 --> 00:10:02.625
Within ourselves

190
00:10:02.625 --> 00:10:06.083
we experience new self-confidence.

191
00:10:06.083 --> 00:10:07.291
We also feel great pride

192
00:10:07.291 --> 00:10:10.791
in our hard work and talent.

193
00:10:10.791 --> 00:10:12.041
After all,

194
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:12.958
this very hard work

195
00:10:12.958 --> 00:10:16.750
and talent gave us success.

196
00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:22.708
When you're shining like a pearl
 in the light of success, shining,

197
00:10:22.708 --> 00:10:27.083
don't forget that string hidden behind

198
00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:30.291
that is holding you.

199
00:10:30.291 --> 00:10:31.875
Remember,

200
00:10:31.875 --> 00:10:35.041
behind your every success

201
00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:38.166
is the hand of many such people

202
00:10:38.166 --> 00:10:40.416
who aren't directly visible.

203
00:10:40.416 --> 00:10:44.208
These can be people working with you.

204
00:10:44.208 --> 00:10:47.416
Can be some well-wisher's guidance.

205
00:10:47.416 --> 00:10:49.875
Can be your life partner's love

206
00:10:49.875 --> 00:10:53.458
and family contribution,

207
00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:56.291
because of which you can

208
00:10:56.291 --> 00:10:59.291
focus on your work without worry.

209
00:10:59.291 --> 00:11:03.458
This is also cooperation of all those resources

210
00:11:03.458 --> 00:11:06.625
that the organization provided you.

211
00:11:06.625 --> 00:11:10.166
This was about individual successes.

212
00:11:10.166 --> 00:11:13.875
Many times when an entire
 organization succeeds,

213
00:11:13.875 --> 00:11:18.291
even then we forget the contribution
 of many departments.

214
00:11:18.291 --> 00:11:21.375
In every organization, there
 are many such departments

215
00:11:21.375 --> 00:11:22.791
that indirectly

216
00:11:22.791 --> 00:11:25.208
just do their work,

217
00:11:25.208 --> 00:11:29.583
keep the organization organized,
 so that other people

218
00:11:29.583 --> 00:11:34.250
can focus their attention on main goals.

219
00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:37.458
Appreciation of all these is necessary.

220
00:11:37.458 --> 00:11:41.333
Whether success is individual
 or of the entire organization.

221
00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:44.000
Recognize those people hidden behind

222
00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:47.000
who are giving their full contribution.

223
00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.500
They also have a big hand in this success.

224
00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:52.916
Respect them.

225
00:11:52.916 --> 00:11:54.875
And this very thinking

226
00:11:54.875 --> 00:11:59.125
will bring humility and gratitude in you.

227
00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:02.708
Remember, the true winner is one

228
00:12:02.708 --> 00:12:06.250
who always remains humble and grateful.
